# BuildKit-specific ignore file for mock-store/Dockerfile - used INSTEAD OF
# (never merged with) the root .dockerignore for this one build, since this
# build's own COPY instructions need mock-store/* (which the root file
# deliberately excludes down to just mock-store/package.json, for the API
# image's build). Mirrors the root file's own pattern, inverted: this build
# needs apps/api/package.json ONLY (for the pnpm workspace install step),
# never apps/api's actual source.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-dev
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
*.md
apps/api/*
!apps/api/package.json
